Modifications
-------------
This fork modifies RikkaHub. Modifications were made in 2026. Summary (see git
history for the complete record):

- Renamed the application to Weishu (𣻷澍) and changed the package to
  com.sevensoft.weishu.
- Removed Firebase Analytics / Crashlytics.
- Removed affiliate / promotional third-party providers and the recommendation list;
  removed the sponsor API, the donation page and the sponsor assets.
- Removed the upstream update checker and the built-in search service that pointed at
  upstream servers (updates.rikka-ai.com, api.rikka-ai.com, sponsors.rikka-ai.com),
  along with in-app links to the upstream website and project.
- Reworked settings structure and hid several settings surfaces.
- Added a built-in tool for reading a user-provided web page.
- Replaced the loading animation with a Material 3 loading indicator.
- Replaced the application icon.

